 "blockers": [],
 "notes": [
  "Record ids (recid / control_number) are shared across commands. Literature ids from search-literature feed get-literature, list-literature-references, list-literature-authors, export-literature and list-citing-papers.",
  "Author ids appear in literature author entries as 'recid'. list-author-publications needs the author's facet_author_name ('RECID_Full Name'), which get-author returns.",
  "Use search-literature's q to find related papers. Institution papers: q='affid 902725'. Experiment papers: q='accelerator_experiments.record.$ref:1108541'. Conference contributions: q='publication_info.conference_record.$ref:3178676' with doc_type='conference paper'.",
  "To find seminars by a speaker, use search-seminars with q='speakers.record.$ref:AUTHOR_ID' and start_date=all. For seminars about a paper, use q='literature_records.record.$ref:LIT_ID'.",
  "The citation summary for an author comes from get-literature-facets with facet_name=citation-summary, search_type=hep-author-publication and author=facet_author_name.",
  "Exports return plain text (BibTeX/LaTeX). export-literature-search accepts size up to 1000.",
  "Some combined filters (date range plus author count plus subject on later pages) returned a server error page in the recording. Retry with fewer filters if a request fails.",
  "No login is required. All commands are public reads."
 ],
